{"id":"4a9e71fcecda1ed2","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Interval Order","display":"df-zfc-order9-interval-order — ZFC Order9 Interval Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-interval-order — ZFC Order9 Interval Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-interval-order — ZFC Order9 Interval Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-total-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\prec,L,\\preceq_L,\\ell,r\\in V\">\\(P,\\prec,L,\\preceq_L,\\ell,r\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, strict order, endpoint order, and endpoint maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9IntervalOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9IntervalOrder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalOrder}\\)</span> (reflexive total-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-total-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}interval\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9IntervalOrder}_S(P,\\prec)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\prec\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\n\\exists L,\\preceq_L,\\ell,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(L,\\preceq_L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,P,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,L)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle\\ell(p),r(p)\\rangle\\in\\preceq_L)\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(p\\prec q\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle r(p),\\ell(q)\\rangle\\in\\preceq_L\\land r(p)\\neq\\ell(q))\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}interval\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9IntervalOrder}_S(P,\\prec)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\prec\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\n\\exists L,\\preceq_L,\\ell,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(L,\\preceq_L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,P,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,L)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle\\ell(p),r(p)\\rangle\\in\\preceq_L)\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(p\\prec q\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle r(p),\\ell(q)\\rangle\\in\\preceq_L\\land r(p)\\neq\\ell(q))\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Endpoints may lie in an arbitrary set-coded linear order, so the definition covers general interval orders rather than only those admitting a real representation. Strict endpoint comparison is the strict part of the upstream reflexive total order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalOrder}$ (reflexive total-order predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\prec,L,\\preceq_L,\\ell,r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9IntervalOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}interval\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9IntervalOrder}_S(P,\\prec)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\prec\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\n\\exists L,\\preceq_L,\\ell,r\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(L,\\preceq_L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,P,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,P,L)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle\\ell(p),r(p)\\rangle\\in\\preceq_L)\\land\n\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(p\\prec q\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle r(p),\\ell(q)\\rangle\\in\\preceq_L\\land r(p)\\neq\\ell(q))\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1584,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2974","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order.md|58-df-zfc-order9-interval-order]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","7ccfc8c88f29968a","043908345fb04de3"]}